- Nginx / server errors (502, timeout, connection refused)
- Backend production debugging
- Deployment failures (Docker / CI/CD)
- ERP / SAP / WMS / TMS integration issues
"""

  [params.contact]
    enable = true
    title = "Contact"
    content = "If you need help with backend or server issues, feel free to contact me."
    email = "fichilzhang@gmail.com"